 "basis": "sized as a medium twin helicopter of a 13-14 m rotor (the AW139 / Bell 412 class): MTOW ~6.4 t; max speed ~78 m/s (150 kn) and cruise ~68 m/s (130 kn); sideward and rearward flight limits 35 and 30 kn; climb ~10 m/s; a hover yaw rate of ~40 deg/s; 45 deg bank, 20 deg pitch in manoeuvres; accelerating at ~0.3 g (nose ~17 deg down), flaring at ~0.4 g. RCS of a helicopter that size (a few m2 nose-on); IR of its exhausts (~500 K) put at the belly. The disc, dome and its flight are fiction."
